{"path":"regex/match_results/size","title":"std::match_results<BidirIt,Alloc>::size","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::match_results&lt;BidirIt,Alloc&gt;::</span>size","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/regex/match_results/size","section":"regex","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the number of submatches, i.e. std::distance(begin(), end()).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size_type size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the number of submatches, i.e. <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/distance\"><span class=\"kw678\">std::<span class=\"me2\">distance</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> does not represent the result of a successful match.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The number of submatches.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;regex&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/basic_regex\"><span class=\"kw2017\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regex</span></span></a> re<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"a(a)*b\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> target<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"aaab\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_results\"><span class=\"kw2027\">std::<span class=\"me2\">smatch</span></span></a> sm<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> sm.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/regex_match\"><span class=\"kw2029\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regex_match</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>target, sm, re<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> sm.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>0\n2</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_results/begin\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>begin</span><span>cbegin</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns iterator to the beginning of the list of sub-matches <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_results/end\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>end</span><span>cend</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns iterator to the end of the list of sub-matches <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"regex","title":"Regular expressions library (since C++11)"},{"path":"regex/match_results","title":"std::match_results"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::match_results<BidirIt,Alloc>::size","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Returns the number of submatches, i.e. std::distance(begin(), end())."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The number of submatches."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"begin, cbegin","note":"returns iterator to the beginning of the list of sub-matches"},{"label":"end, cend","note":"returns iterator to the end of the list of sub-matches"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":100,"codeBlockCount":2}
